<title>USA: Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freddie Mac revised</p>
<p>short-term discount note rates Monday as follows:</p>
<p> -		 MATURITY--RATE</p>
<p> -		Overnight--5.22</p>
<p> -		    Nov 8--5.18</p>
<p> -	Nov 13,20,21,27--5.19</p>
<p> -		    Dec 2--5.18</p>
<p> -		  Feb 4,5--5.19</p>
</text>
